sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant Auth as Auth Controller
    participant Booking as Booking Engine
    participant DB as Database
    participant Payment as Payment Gateway API
    participant Email as Email Service API

    Customer->>UI: Selects Event & Picks Seats
    UI->>Booking: POST /api/seats/lock (SeatIDs, EventID)
    Booking->>DB: Update Seat Status to 'Locked'
    DB-->>Booking: Confirmation (10-min timer started)
    Booking-->>UI: Seat Lock Success & Order Summary

    Customer->>UI: Enters Payment Details & Submits
    UI->>Booking: POST /api/checkout (PaymentToken, OrderDetails)
    Booking->>Payment: Process Payment (Amount, Token)
    
    alt Payment Successful
        Payment-->>Booking: Transaction Success Token
        Booking->>DB: Update Seat Status to 'Sold'
        Booking->>DB: Create Booking Record (BookingID, UserID)
        Booking->>Booking: Generate Encrypted QR Code
        Booking->>Email: Send Digital Pass PDF (EmailPayload, QR)
        Email-->>Booking: Email Dispatched
        Booking-->>UI: 200 OK (Booking Confirmation & QR Pass)
        UI-->>Customer: Display Order Confirmation Screen
    else Payment Failed
        Payment-->>Booking: Transaction Failed
        Booking->>DB: Revert Seat Status to 'Available'
        Booking-->>UI: Payment Failure Alert
        UI-->>Customer: Display Error & Prompt Retry
    end
